                                "sense_id": "cd3775fa-b96c-3b32-8da8-75bf035cef26",
                                "text": "She was no longer the alert, vivacious American beauty who had charmed and delighted all who came in contact with her. Instead she was a very quiet and sad little girl—with an expression of hopeless wistfulness that none but Hazel Strong could interpret."
